{"sections":[{"slug":"Hitchin模叠","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Hitchin模叠"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Hitchin <span lang=\"zh\">模叠</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Hitchin 模叠”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<blockquote>\n<p>The Hitchin moduli stack $\\mathcal M_G$ is essentially the total space of the cotangent bundle of $\\mathrm{Bun}_G$, therefore perverse sheaves on $\\mathrm{Bun}_G$ are related to the symplectic geometry of $\\mathcal M_G$ via the characteristic cycle construction. — <span lang=\"zh\">恽之伟</span>, Hitchin-type moduli spaces in automorphic representation theory</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛的模空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛的模空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">在主丛</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">处的切空间</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">的无穷小形变的空间</span> $H^1(X,\\operatorname{ad}E)$, <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Serre对偶","text":"Serre <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等同于</span> $H^0(X,\\mathcal K_X\\otimes\\operatorname{ad}E)$, <span lang=\"zh\">其元素称为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Higgs场","text":"Higgs <span lang=\"zh\">场</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}